#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""VR Control: one window to stream PC VR games to a Meta Quest over Wi-Fi with WiVRn.

- Setup tab        -> checks everything needed is installed/configured, with one-click fixes
- Hotspot switch   -> a NetworkManager Wi-Fi hotspot (access point) for the headset
- WiVRn switch     -> starts wivrn-server from the WiVRn Flatpak / quits it over D-Bus
- Pairing PIN      -> io.github.wivrn.Server.EnablePairing
- Live status      -> WiVRn D-Bus properties, hotspot clients, Wi-Fi throughput, GPU
- Audio            -> optionally moves sound output / microphone to the headset while connected

https://github.com/Pxl-Box/vr-control
"""
